Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Like, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「俺がYeの代弁者だ」とか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:06.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and I don't like somebody saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:06.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}well, I'm gonna be the voice of Ye,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:06.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「Yeの唯一の声だ」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:06.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}「唯一のマネージャーだ」とか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:10.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}the only voice of Ye,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:10.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the only manager of Ye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:10.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}言われるのが嫌なんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:13.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Like, I look at every single bill I pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:13.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}払う請求書は全部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:13.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}自分で目を通してる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:17.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I only pay bills on a Friday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:17.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and I look at every one,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:17.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}支払いは金曜だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:17.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}一枚ずつ確認してる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:19.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}one by one by one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:19.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}一枚ずつ、一枚ずつな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:26.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Like, I was thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:26.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}getting to be a billionaire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:26.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}億万長者になったら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:26.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}もう働かなくていいと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:30.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}would take me out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:30.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}of having to do work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:30.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}思ってたんだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:34.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Now one of my biggest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:34.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}jobs is keeping my money,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:34.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}今じゃ一番の仕事は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:34.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}自分の金を守ることだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:37.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}because there's a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:37.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}of people that's on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:37.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}だって俺の金を取ることを
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.47,0:00:40.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}a full-time job to take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.47,0:00:40.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}my money, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.47,0:00:40.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}フルタイムでやってる奴が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.47,0:00:40.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}いっぱいいるからな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And I've literally lost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}hundreds of millions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ちゃんと見てなかったせいで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:47.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}of dollars by not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:47.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}looking close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:47.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}マジで何億ドルも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:47.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}失ってきたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So it reminded me of what Shaq said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}それで思い出したのが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}シャキールオニールの話でさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}when he had the deal and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}he had the studio in his crib,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}契約してた時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}家にスタジオがあったのに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:58.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and when he got the check,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:58.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}明細を見たら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.73,0:01:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}he looked at what the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.73,0:01:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}label was charging him,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.73,0:01:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}レーベルがスタジオ代を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:01.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and they were charging
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:01.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}him for studio time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:01.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}請求してたんだって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}He was like, the studio's at my crib!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「スタジオ俺ん家だぞ！」って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:04.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And then he got a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:04.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}hundred thousand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:04.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}で、数十万ドル取り返した
